# DATA-SIZE EXCEPTION (plan §3.4): the raw NSSP JSON is ~2 MB and the raw
# bed JSON ~80k rows, over the portfolio file-size rule, so raw data is
# git-ignored and downloaded at build time by
# `python -m src.data_pipeline --live`. Only the small provenance
# artefacts are committed (data/raw/sample_rows.json, compact processed
# CSVs). This is the one deliberate deviation from the "do NOT ignore
# data/" rule (Day 1 lesson (d)).
data/raw/nssp_ed_visits.json
data/raw/bed_capacity.json
data/raw/*_synthetic.json
